      ],
      "source": "https://www.grandchaletcolorado.com/blog/the-history-of-tabernash-colorado",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Tabernash’s early economy relied heavily on lumber, with sawmills processing timber from the surrounding Rockies.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
